{
  "job_C16.2_20251003_115216": {
    "chunk_text": "flyh\u00f0, ra\u00f0e he bi\u00f0 gecydd dead, o\u00f0\u00f0e Furtum difficile inuenitur stale earfo\u00f0lice bi\u00f0 funden. Puer natus uix euadit; post quinque annos sepe inutilis moritur cild acenned unea\u00f0e \u00e6twint; \u00e6fter fif Puella pessima moritur, quia malefica & herbaria m\u00e6den wyrst swelt, for\u00fei yfeld\u00e6da & wyrtg\u00e6lstre. Qui recumbit, moritur se\u00fee geli\u00f0, he swelt. Somnia sunt; effectum habent swefnu sint; gefremmige habba\u00f0. Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere nis na god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna sexta; furtum inuenitur mona se sixta; stalu bi\u00f0 funden. Qui recumbit, diu & leniter languescit se\u00fee geli\u00f0, lange & li\u00f0elice he adla\u00f0. Qui nascitur, audax, magnus, multum astutus se\u00fee bi\u00f0 acenned, \u00feriste, m\u00e6re, swi\u00f0e aberd. Si annos XVIIII euaserit, fortunatus erit Gif he gear nigontyne \u00e6twint, ges\u00e6lig he bi\u00f0. Signum habet in dextera manu tacn hef\u00f0 on swi\u00f0ram handu. Puella nata casta uiris accepta grata in omnibus bonis m\u00e6den acenned cl\u00e6ne, werum gecweme, Somnia sunt certa; noli reuelare swefne synt gewisse ; nelle \u00feu awreon. Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere nys na god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna VII; sanguinem minuere, medicare, uel domare castrare bonum est mona se syfo\u00f0a, blod l\u00e6tan, Fugitiuus inuenitur flema bi\u00f0 gemet. Furtum conualescit \u00feyf\u00f0 gestranga",
